  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1025/223/more-villagers-cover.png\" alt=\"More Villagers 封面\"></p>\n<p>這是將《More Villagers》移植到新版本的一款模組，為原版遊戲增添了更多村民，包含全新的職業與工作臺，並附有獨特的交易與額外進度。</p>\n<h3>前往 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-villagers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">More Villagers</span></a> 了解更多資訊！</h3>\n<h3>本模組依賴 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/villagerapi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">VillagerAPI</a>，請確保已同時安裝該模組，否則本模組將無法正常運作。</h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/aPPEPJWG39\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/GFT3JFP/req-discord-130x130.png\" alt=\"Discord 伺服器邀請連結\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h3>⚠️問題回報：</h3>\n<p>請勿將本模組的問題回報給原作者，而是請透過本頁面提供的連結至 GitHub Issue Tracker 進行回報。</p>\n<hr>\n<h3>📝新功能：</h3>\n<p>透過 <code>villagerpacks</code>，您可以在不編寫任何程式碼的情況下，新增自訂村民職業與生物群落類型。前往 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmorevillagers.neoterra.online%252fvillager-pack-gen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://morevillagers.neoterra.online/villager-pack-gen</a> 了解更多資訊。</p>\n<hr>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1370/500/badlands-villagers-more-villagers-png.png\" alt=\"曠野村民\"></p>\n<h2>隆重推出<strong>曠野</strong>村民</h2>\n<p>生成於<strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">曠野</span></strong>、<strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">林木曠野</span></strong>與<strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">侵蝕曠野</span></strong></p>\n<hr>\n<p>所有交易的完整清單可於此處查看：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmorevillagers.neoterra.online%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://morevillagers.neoterra.online</a></p>",
